{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日メンバーと一緒♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"空き時間が長かったためカラオケに行ってきました(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何グループかに部屋を分かれたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と生駒氏は宿題やるチームとして歌わない部屋に行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど...やっぱり我慢できなかった！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局3時間中の1時間くらい歌ってしまいました(￣ω￣)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/%E7%94%9F%E7%94%B0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンション上がって踊りだす生駒氏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/4135212/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒氏は主にボカロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は津軽海峡やアイドル曲など幅広く歌いました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったー(*´∀`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちゃんと宿題もやりましたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人ともプリント3枚分くらい進みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/4135212/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また勉強カラオケ行きたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/01/4135212/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","